# Welcome

Hi, I'm Pranav RK. This is my personal website where I write about programming, games, books, and other things that interest me.

## What you'll find here

- **[Blog](/blog/)** - Thoughts on programming, game development, book reviews, and random musings
- **[About](/about/)** - A bit more about me and what I do
- **[Work](/work/)** - Projects I've worked on and things I've built

Feel free to explore and get in touch if something catches your interest.